    "body": "Summary:\nFollow up #5391.\n\nUpdate launcher provisioning imports and controller setup to use the ActorSystem API. Pass allocated host meshes to the configured actor system and apply RL environment defaults before importing torch-dependent modules.\n\nRemove redundant tests that compare method names, signatures, or a default configuration type. Existing behavioral tests cover router dispatch, Verifiers setup with the controller's arguments, Monarch provisioning, and trainer rank grouping.\n\nReviewed By: fegin\n\nDifferential Revision: D125905793\n",
